### MindMark Iteration 12 - exam closed-loop smoke requests
### Prerequisite: backend is running at http://localhost:8080
### Frontend real API mode: VITE_USE_MOCK=false pnpm web:dev

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@studentId = student-001
@paperId = paper-001
@examId = exam-001
@answerSheetId = AS-exam-001-student-001
@gradingTaskId = GT-AS-exam-001-student-001

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### API Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system/health

### Question bank
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/questions?page=1&pageSize=20&status=ACTIVE

### Papers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/papers?page=1&pageSize=20

### Paper detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/papers/{{paperId}}

### Update paper status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/papers/{{paperId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "READY"
}

### Teacher exam list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/exams

### Create exam
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/exams
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Frontend Engineering Runtime Smoke",
  "paperId": "{{paperId}}",
  "classIds": ["class-frontend-1"],
  "startAt": "2026-07-17T14:00:00+08:00",
  "endAt": "2026-07-17T15:30:00+08:00",
  "durationMinutes": 90
}

### Get exam detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/exams/{{examId}}

### Student exam list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/student/exams?studentId={{studentId}}

### Answer sheet detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/answer-sheets/{{answerSheetId}}

### Answer sheet by exam and student
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/answer-sheets/by-exam/{{examId}}?studentId={{studentId}}

### Save answer draft
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/answer-sheets/{{answerSheetId}}/draft
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": [
    { "questionId": "Q-1001", "answer": "B" },
    { "questionId": "Q-1003", "answer": "False" },
    { "questionId": "Q-1005", "answer": "Resources are identified by URIs and manipulated through HTTP methods such as GET, POST, PUT and DELETE." }
  ],
  "clientSavedAt": "2026-07-17T14:20:00+08:00"
}

### Submit answer sheet
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/answer-sheets/{{answerSheetId}}/submit

### Grading tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/grading-tasks

### Auto grade
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/grading-tasks/{{gradingTaskId}}/auto-grade

### Review grading item
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/grading-tasks/{{gradingTaskId}}/items/Q-1005/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "finalScore": 6,
  "comment": "Manual item review smoke."
}

### Review grading task
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/grading-tasks/{{gradingTaskId}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "finalScore": 12,
  "comment": "Runtime smoke review completed."
}

### Exam score summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/exams/{{examId}}/scores

### Publish scores
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/exams/{{examId}}/publish-scores

### Student score reports
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/student/score-reports?studentId={{studentId}}